               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this class, we learned how to write the first Mesoamerican numbers using the three symbols they created.\n\nWe also learned that these are not the only numbers used in Mesoamerica. In the next class, we will continue learning about Mesoamerican numbers.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
